    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70818" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νήχῠτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νη-, χέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>full-flowing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philet.
					21
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.530
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλμη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.1367
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐρώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					313
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱδρώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					587
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					1.417
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. ὄρπηξ</span> a <i>juicy</i>
			sapling, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				33
			</span></i>. (Prob. formed on the supposition that <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νη-</span> had an intens. force.)</div>
